  "view": "<div :class=\"getStyles()\" role=\"document\" x-data=\"Challenge\" x-init=\"id = 50; max_attempts = 100; attempts = 0\">\n  <div class=\"modal-content\">\n    <div class=\"modal-body py-4 px-4 px-sm-5\">\n\n      <div>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn-close float-end\" data-bs-dismiss=\"modal\" aria-label=\"Close\"></button>\n\n        <ul class=\"nav nav-tabs\">\n          <li class=\"nav-item\">\n            <button class=\"nav-link active\" data-bs-target=\"#challenge\" @click=\"showChallenge()\">\n              Challenge\n            </button>\n          </li>\n\n          \n            \n            <li class=\"nav-item\">\n              <button class=\"nav-link challenge-submissions\" data-bs-target=\"#submissions\" @click=\"showSubmissions()\">\n                \n              </button>\n            </li>\n            \n          \n\n          \n            \n          \n\n          \n            \n          \n        </ul>\n      </div>\n\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"tab-content\">\n          <div role=\"tabpanel\" class=\"tab-pane fade show active\" id=\"challenge\">\n            <h2 class=\"challenge-name text-center pt-3\">\n              Bedside Manner\n            </h2>\n            <h3 class=\"challenge-value text-center\">\n              15\n            </h3>\n\n\n            \n              <div class=\"challenge-tags text-center pt-2 pb-3\">\n                \n                  \n                    <span class=\"challenge-tag badge bg-info\">syyntax</span>\n                  \n                    <span class=\"challenge-tag badge bg-info\">medical device</span>\n                  \n                    <span class=\"challenge-tag badge bg-info\">web</span>\n                  \n                \n              </div>\n            \n\n            <small class=\"challenge-attribution text-center text-muted\">\n              <p>@syyntax</p>\n\n            </small>\n\n            <span class=\"challenge-desc\"><iframe src=\"\" style=\"background-image: url('https://deadface.sfo3.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/2026/img/wayfinder/brainscans.png');background-size:cover;background-position:center center;background-origin:content-box;background-repeat:no-repeat;background-color:rgba(40, 40, 40,0);min-height:80px;height:130px;width:100%;padding:10px;border:none\" title=\"Thumbnail\"></iframe>\n<sup>Created By: <code>@syyntax</code></sup>\n<div style=\"\n    border: 1px solid #d97706;\n    border-left: 5px solid #d97706;\n    background-color: #fffbeb;\n    color: #78350f;\n    padding: 16px 18px;\n    margin: 20px 0;\n    border-radius: 6px;\n    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n\" role=\"alert\">\n    <strong style=\"display: block; margin-bottom: 6px; font-size: 1.05rem;\">\n        ⚠ Warning\n    </strong>\n    <span>\n        This is an experimental series of challenges designed to introduce players to the niche field of medical device penetration testing. This series is supposed to simulate physical access to the device. As such, please do not conduct port scans or any kind of brute forcing - they are not needed for this series of challenges.\n    </span>\n</div>\n<p>DEADFACE is taking credit for an attack that compromised patient data at St Dymphna's Medical Center. Somehow, DEADFACE acquired sensitive patient records from the medical center that used the device. Funny thing is, the device that housed the data is internal without access to the internet. Which means DEADFACE would have had to have physically infiltrated the medical center!</p>\n<p>The medical center sent us security camera footage of two individuals who told staff they were with IT, but when we asked the IT department, they said they have no idea who they were.</p>\n<p>We're giving you access to the device we believe was compromised. We're asking you to conduct a medical device penetration test on the machine to identify vulnerabilities so we can determine if (and how) the device was compromised.</p>\n<p>Your first task is to identify any lingering strings developer's may have left in the device's kiosk web browser.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://emedra.dctf.io:8080\">Access the Device</a></p>\n</span>\n\n            \n\n            \n\n            \n\n            <template x-if=\"max_attempts > 0\">\n              <p class=\"text-center\">\n                <span x-text=\"attempts\"></span>/<span x-text=\"max_attempts\"></span> tentatives\n              </p>\n            </template>\n\n            <div class=\"row submit-row\">\n              <div class=\"col-12 col-sm-8\">\n                \n                  <input\n                      id=\"challenge-id\" class=\"challenge-id\" type=\"hidden\"\n                      value=\"50\"\n                  >\n                  <input\n                      id=\"challenge-input\" class=\"challenge-input form-control\"\n                      type=\"text\" name=\"submission\"\n                      @keyup.enter=\"submitChallenge()\"\n                      placeholder=\"Flag\" x-model=\"submission\"\n                  >\n                \n              </div>\n\n              <div class=\"col-12 col-sm-4 mt-3 mt-sm-0 key-submit\">\n                \n                  <button\n                      id=\"challenge-submit\"\n                      class=\"challenge-submit btn btn-outline-secondary w-100 h-100\" type=\"submit\"\n                      @click.debounce.500ms=\"submitChallenge()\"\n                  >\n                    Soumettre\n                  </button>\n                \n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"row notification-row\">\n              <div class=\"col-12\">\n                <template x-if=\"response\">\n                  \n                  <div class=\"alert text-center w-100 mt-3\"\n                      :class=\"{\n                        'alert-success': response.data.status == 'correct',\n                        'alert-info': response.data.status == 'already_solved',\n                        'alert-danger': response.data.status == 'incorrect',\n                        'alert-warning': response.data.status == 'paused',\n                      }\" role=\"alert\"\n                  >\n                    <strong x-text=\"response.data.message\"></strong>\n                    <div x-show=\"(response.data.status == 'correct' || response.data.status == 'already_solved')\">\n                      <div x-show=\"getNextId()\">\n                        <button @click=\"nextChallenge()\" class=\"btn btn-info mt-3\">\n                          Challenge suivant\n                        </button>\n                      </div>\n                      \n                      <div>\n                        <button x-show=\"!share_url\" @click=\"getShareUrl()\" class=\"btn btn-sm btn-outline-info mt-3\">\n                          Partager\n                        </button>\n                        <div class=\"btn-group mt-3\" role=\"group\" x-show=\"share_url\">\n                          <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary\" @click=\"copyShareUrl()\" data-bs-toggle=\"tooltip\" data-bs-title=\"Copied!\">\n                            <i class=\"fa-solid fa-copy\"></i>\n                          </button>\n                          <a :href=\"'https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?url=' + encodeURIComponent(share_url)\" role=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <i class=\"fa-brands fa-twitter\"></i>\n                          </a>\n                          <a :href=\"'https://www.facebook.com/sharer/sharer.php?u=' + encodeURIComponent(share_url)\" role=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <i class=\"fa-brands fa-facebook-f\"></i>\n                          </a>\n                          <a :href=\"'http://www.linkedin.com/shareArticle?url=' + encodeURIComponent(share_url)\" role=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <i class=\"fa-brands fa-linkedin-in\"></i>\n                          </a>\n                        </div>\n                      </div>\n                      \n                    </div>\n                  </div>\n                </template>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div role=\"tabpanel\" class=\"tab-pane fade\" id=\"submissions\">\n            <div class=\"row\">\n              <div class=\"col-md-12\">\n                <table class=\"table table-striped align-middle text-center\">\n                  <thead>\n                  <tr>\n                    <th>Submission</th>\n                    <th>Type</th>\n                    <th>Date</th>\n                  </tr>\n                  </thead>\n                  <tbody id=\"challenge-submission-names\">\n                  <template x-for=\"submission in submissions\">\n                    <tr>\n                      <td x-data=\"{ truncate: true }\">\n                        <code x-text=\"truncate ? '*'.repeat(submission.provided.length) : submission.provided\"></code>\n                        <button class=\"btn btn-link p-0 pl-1\" @click=\"truncate = !truncate\">\n                          <i :class=\"truncate ? 'fas fa-eye' : 'fas fa-eye-slash'\"></i>\n                        </button>\n                      </td>\n                      <td x-text=\"submission.type\"></td>\n                      <td x-text=\"submission.date\"></td>\n                    </tr>\n                  </template>\n                  </tbody>\n                </table>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div role=\"tabpanel\" class=\"tab-pane fade\" id=\"solves\">\n            <div class=\"row\">\n              <div class=\"col-md-12\">\n                <table class=\"table table-striped align-middle text-center\">\n                  <thead>\n                  <tr>\n                    <th>Nom</th>\n                    <th>Date</th>\n                  </tr>\n                  </thead>\n                  <tbody id=\"challenge-solves-names\">\n                  <template x-for=\"solve in solves\">\n                    <tr>\n                      <td>\n                        <a :href=\"solve.account_url\" x-text=\"solve.name\"></a>\n                      </td>\n                      <td x-text=\"solve.date\"></td>\n                    </tr>\n                  </template>\n                  </tbody>\n                </table>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div role=\"tabpanel\" class=\"tab-pane fade\" id=\"solution\">\n            <div class=\"row\">\n              <div class=\"col-md-12\">\n                <div class=\"challenge-solution-content pt-3\">\n                  <template x-if=\"solution\">\n                    <div x-html=\"solution\" style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">\n                    </div>\n                  </template>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
